{"COVER_ME","",{"Watch out for me, will you?","Don't leave me on my own with this!","Give me a little help here!","Keep watching while I do this!","I need you paying attention!","Look out for me for a second!","Stay ready. I need your help","Don't let anything get to me!","A little help would be good right now!","Keep me from getting caught out!","Eyes up, please. I need a moment","Don't stop watching!","Help me get through this bit!","Stay with me. Just for a moment"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Cover me! Please! Cover me!","Someone watch my back while I do this!"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=law",{"Cover me! Moving!","I'm moving up - cover me from that corner","Moving up, need cover on the left","Cover me, I'm going for the high ground... I mean, I'm going forward","Need cover, need cover, moving up","Deputy, cover my movement","Cover, cover, cover","Watch my back, I'm repositioning","Keep them busy, I'm moving to better position","Cover! Cover! I'm going for it!"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=swat",{"Moving - cover","Covering, moving","Cover me, moving up","I'm moving, give me cover","Cover left, going","Break, break, I'm displacing, cover","Give me suppression, moving now"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=military",{"Cover me! Going!","Covering fire! I'm moving!","Going now, cover my approach, sergeant","Covering fire, covering fire!","Provide cover, I'm advancing","Sir, request covering fire, moving up","Moving, give me cover","Cover me, sergeant, going now"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Cover me! I'm going in!","Somebody watch my back, damn it!","Cover me! COVER ME!","Cover my ass, I'm going!","Cover me, damn it, COVER me!","You watch my back, I'll watch yours, GO","I'm moving, don't you shoot me, you hear?!","Keep 'em off me while I run for it","Cover! Cover! I'm making a break for it!","Somebody cover me, fuckin' hell, why's it always me?"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Cover me! Cover me! Somebody COVER ME!","I'm going, I'm going, please watch my back, please","Don't let anything get me while I go, okay? Okay?!","Hang on, I'm gonna make a run for it, just- keep an eye on me, please!","If I don't make it, tell- tell- just cover me, please!","Draw their eyes, anything, just not on me!","My back- somebody get my back, I'm serious!"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Cover me, I'm making a dash for it","Watch my side while I move, okay?","Keep your eyes on me, I'm going across","Anyone behind me? Cover my back, please","I need to move, keep them off me"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Cover me, moving","Cover my left, going now","On my way, watch my back","Keep their heads down, I'm crossing","Keep their heads down, I need two seconds","Watch my back, thanks","Give me a lane, I'm going through","Moving up, eyes on the sides","Go on three, you cover, I go, then switch"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=angry",{"Cover me, damn it, I'm out here alone!","Where's my cover?! I said COVER ME!"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"Cover me, I'm moving","Covering my approach, thanks","Eyes on me, I'm going now"}},
{"COVER_ME","role=soldier_green",{"Cover me? Please cover me? I'm going!","Is it okay to go? I'm going, please cover, please"}},
{"COVER_ME","role=soldier_nco",{"Covering, you move on my word","Cover me, trainee, watch the lane"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=elite",{"Covering","Displacing, cover this lane","Going, cover left"}},
{"COVER_ME","role=elite_delta",{"Moving across, overwatch please","Displacing"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=fresh",{"Cover me, cover me, please, I'm scared"}},
{"COVER_ME","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Cover me, I'm going to say hello","Watch my back, I want to see them up close"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Look out! One's crawling on the ground!","Down there! It's got no legs!","Ah! Something on the ground!"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=law",{"Crawler on the ground - watch your feet","Down at my feet - careful","Crawler down low, mind your boots","Infected, prone, still mobile, stay clear","One crawling at ten o'clock, don't get close","Subject down but moving, it's not a casualty, back off","Prone infected, I'll handle it from a distance","Unit, heads up, one crawling","Careful, careful, it's an infected, not an injured civilian","Don't get low next to it, it'll take your hand"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=swat",{"Crawler - low","Prone infected, low, left","Crawler, three meters, avoid","One crawling, mind your feet","Ground target, ground target, slow","Crawler, stay off it, I'll clear","Down low! Down low! Watch your legs!"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=military",{"Crawler on the deck!","Watch the floor! One's crawling!","Crawler, low and slow, don't step near it","Prone infected, watch your boots","One crawling, one, keep distance","Sir, one's dragging itself toward the squad","Careful, careful, don't walk past a downed one without checking","Crawler, front, hold fire, it's not worth a round"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=elite",{"Crawler - ground level","Prone infected","Crawler, ignore, move around","One crawling, avoiding"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Crawler! Watch your ankles!","Eh, something crawling over here","Ugh, look at that, crawling around like a damn worm","Watch your feet, boys, one of 'em's still wiggling","It's got no legs, ha, no legs and it still wants to bite","Kick it in the face, go on, kick it","Don't give it your ankle, idiot","Hey, it's crawling at you, Mike, it's crawling at you","Crawler! Stomp it before it gets to my boot","Oh, that's disgusting, put it down, somebody put it down","There's a stump of a thing slithering on the ground, shoot it","Aw, damn, I thought it was dead, I almost stepped on it","That one's lost its legs but kept its appetite, ha","Move your damn feet, there's one down there"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh my God, it's- it's CRAWLING, it's still coming and it's crawling!","Down there! Down THERE! Something's dragging itself at my feet!","Ugh- ugh- UGH, no legs, how does it still- noooo","It's looking up at me, it's looking right up at me, I'm gonna be sick","Don't step there, don't step there, there's one on the ground!","I thought it was dead, I walked right past, I thought it was dead!","It's pulling itself with its hands, oh God, with its HANDS","Why won't it stop? It can't even walk and it won't stop!","Something grabbed my boot- AAAH- no, no, I'm okay, it's just- it's there, down there","Shit, shit, watch your ankles, there's one down low... on the ground, I mean, on the ground!","It's reaching, it's REACHING, it's so low I almost tripped on it","Oh no, it's a crawler, a little one... I can't look at it"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"There's one on the ground, watch your feet","Careful, one's crawling over there, keep back","Something's down low, I think it's trying to follow us","Hey, hey, look down, one of them is dragging itself","Slow, it's slow, it can't stand, but don't let it grab you","Wait, don't walk that way, one of them is lying there","I almost stepped on it, I thought it was a body","It's got no legs, I think, how's it even moving","Aw, God, look at it crawl, that's just sad and scary at the same time","A crawler! Over there, at the edge, see it?","Ground level, keep your feet out of reach"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Crawler, low, watch your ankles","Don't step over it, go around, give it space","One on the ground, we'll put it down from a distance","Down low, don't get your legs near it","Crawler, ten feet, I'll take it","Mind your feet, one of them is dragging","Dead one on its belly, don't turn your back to it","Ground one, it's slow, let it come and stomp it","Careful, they play dead sometimes, keep a step back","I hate the crawling ones, they get you when you're not looking","Look down before you step, there's one","That one's dragging a leg, nobody go near"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Even crawling, it still wants us... that's how much it wants us","Poor thing, can't walk, still coming","Look at it dragging along, you almost have to respect that"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"There's one on the ground, nothing to worry about","Crawler on the ground there, just walk around it","Ground infected, not a threat if we keep distance"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=family_elder",{"Oh, the poor thing, it's crawling, Lord have mercy","Watch where you step, honey, one's on the ground","I don't want to look at it, tell me when it's over"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=family_youth",{"Ew! Gross! Gross gross gross! One's crawling!","Dude, it's got no legs and it's STILL coming","That's messed up, man, it's just a- it's crawling!"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Low target, low target, crawler on the left","Watch your footing, one's crawling, give it a wide berth","Crawler, I've got my tool, keep your boots clear"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=rescue_medical",{"There's a person down, no, it's not, it's an infected, crawling","Oh God, I almost went to help it, it's not a patient","Don't kneel next to it, it will bite, it's down but it's not out"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, even now, dragging itself toward the living","Step around it gently, may the Lord forgive us"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=worker",{"There's one crawling over there, I'll stomp it","Aw hell, it's on its belly, look out for your boots","Watch out, got one down low... on the ground, I mean, the ground"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=civilian_loner",{"Crawler, low, I'll go around","Dead one dragging along, no rush"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=soldier_green",{"Sarge, there's one on the ground! Is it dead? It's moving! It's moving!","Oh God, it looks up at you, why does it look up at you?","Sir, it grabbed at my boot, sir, I'm okay, I'm okay"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=soldier_nco",{"Watch your feet, trainee, they're not all standing","Crawler, step away, don't waste a round, I'll do it"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=militia",{"Crawler, boys, stomp it or step around it","It's dragging a leg, easy enough to avoid"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=fresh",{"Oh my God, it's down there, it's going for my leg!","It's crawling! It's crawling right at me!"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Hey, little guy, where you going? Haha, down you go","Squash it, squash it flat","Stomp, stomp, stomp, go on, make it stop moving"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=prisoner",{"Hell no, I'm not walking by that","It's crawling after me, man, crawling after me"}},
{"CRAWLER_SPOTTED","role=biker",{"Watch the boots, brother, there's one on the ground","Dead one low, brother, boots clear of it"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=law|world=vehicle",{"Somebody remind me to check the cruiser's oil, I keep forgetting","Cruiser's almost out of gas, need to siphon something"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=law",{"I need about ten hours of sleep and a clean uniform - I'll take either one","Drink some water, everybody - Heat'll drop you faster than they will","We're low on batteries for the radios - keep an eye out","If anybody finds boot polish, it's mine, I don't care how that sounds","Eat something, I don't want anybody fainting on me","Another day, another set of reports nobody will read"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=swat",{"Check your gear - then eat","Batteries for the lights, that's what we're short on","Somebody find me dry socks and I'll owe you","Drink water, the vests cook you in this heat","I need ten minutes with my boots off","Gear's wearing out, need new boots"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=swat|hour=16,5",{"Clean your weapon tonight, nobody skips it"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=military,elite",{"Hydrate, I'm not carrying anybody with heatstroke","Field strip and clean before chow - no exceptions","Food's short, half portions till we get more","Rotate the watch every two hours - sleep when you're off"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=military,elite|world=water",{"Who's got the foot powder? Mine went in the river","Somebody look for iodine tablets - Creek water's all we've got"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Fill every pot and the bathtub while it still runs - water won't last forever, you watch","Has anybody seen the can opener? The good one?","I'd trade my whole bag for a cold shower","We're down to one roll of toilet paper, I'm just saying it out loud","Somebody's got to go get water - not me, I went yesterday","My feet hurt so bad, I need different shoes"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Who drank my last beer? Somebody's getting hurt","Need smokes - bad, somebody find me smokes","Gas, we need gas or we're walking","I ain't eaten since yesterday, somebody cook something","Find me some aspirin before my head splits"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison|world=door",{"Second floor's the only floor worth sleeping on, tie some bedsheets and you got a back door"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=civilian",{"Found a can of corn, dented, but it's good","Need to boil more water today"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=family",{"Kids need new shoes - where do I even find those?","Baby's out of formula, I'll have to look"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=worker",{"Wrench is missing again, somebody's walking off with my tools"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=worker|world=generator",{"Generator needs gas - any ideas?"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=worker|world=door",{"Got a hinge to fix, door's falling off"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=rescue",{"Bandages are low, we need to find more"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=rescue|world=building",{"Station roof leaks, I'll patch it later"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=military",{"Ration count is low, report it to the sergeant","Weapons cleaned and inspected"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=elite",{"Resupply is overdue"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=outlaw",{"Out of smokes, that's an emergency"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=outlaw|world=building",{"Need to find a place with a roof"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=raider",{"Rations are low, we need to raid someone","Everyone eating? Good, then we move"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=gang",{"We're out of beer, this is a crisis"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=gang|world=generator",{"Somebody get the generator running"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=club",{"Gas for the bikes, that's priority number one","Brothers, we need parts for the Harley"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=crime",{"Ledger doesn't balance - somebody's skimming","We're short on liquid assets, gentlemen"}},
{"DAILY_NEEDS","reg=prison",{"Nothing to eat, nothing to do - Typical","I'm gonna find a mattress today"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Sun's coming up, we made it through the night","Morning - another day"}},
{"DAWN","reg=law",{"Sunrise, time to see what's out there"}},
{"DAWN","reg=military",{"Dawn - shift change"}},
{"DAWN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Sun's up, time to move","Dawn already? I hate the sun","Morning, you bastards, wake up","Sun's up, get off your asses","Ugh, I need sleep, I need a drink, I need both","Let's see what the day has for us, heh"}},
{"DAWN","",{"Sun's coming up, look at that","Another morning, we made it through another night","First light, first light, thank God","Birds are starting up, hear them?","Gray on the horizon, almost day","Dawn already? Feels like I just closed my eyes","There it is, the sun, hello old friend","Sky's turning pink, it's actually pretty","Morning, morning, everybody up","Rise and shine, rise and, ugh, who am I kidding","Mist on the ground, soft, quiet, nobody's out","Finally getting light. I could use that","Night's over, night's finally over","Another day... whatever that's worth","Dew on the grass, cold on my boots"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"It's light, it's light, we're alive, we're still alive","Morning, thank God, morning, I thought it would never come","Please let today be better, please, please","Did we really make it? Did we actually make it?"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"Another sunrise, and nobody's here to see it with me","Mornings used to smell like coffee and bacon, remember?","He'd have loved this sky, he would have loved it"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Good morning, good morning, you beautiful people, good morning","Look at that sky, it's like they painted it","Whoever's alive, good morning, we got another one"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Sun's up, so are we, let's get going","Gonna check on the water first, then look around","Dawn watch, I'm taking the east side, you take the west","Early light is the best light to travel in, let's go","Coffee? No coffee? Right, no coffee, never mind"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Sunrise and another day of the same","Sun's up, so is the smell, fantastic"}},
{"DAWN","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Rooster's missing, so I'll crow, cock-a-doodle-doo, ha","Mornin', sunshine, you look like death warmed over, same here","Five more minutes, Mama, five more minutes, heh"}},
{"DAWN","reg=rescue",{"Sunrise, change of shift, check on everyone, one by one","Checking on everybody before breakfast, bandages first"}},
{"DAWN","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, thank you for the light, thank you for another morning","Morning prayers, anyone who wants to join, there's room"}},
{"DAWN","role=rescue_medical",{"Dawn rounds, vitals first, then wounds, then breakfast"}},
{"DAWN","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"First light, shift change, eyes on the street","Used to love the early shift, quiet streets, empty roads"}},
{"DAWN","reg=law,swat",{"Dawn patrol, boring as ever, nothing to report","Sun's up, which means the fog's lifting, watch for movement"}},
{"DAWN","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"The dead don't care about sunrises, but we do, keep your head on a swivel"}},
{"DAWN","reg=swat",{"Dawn, positions hold, rotate watch"}},
{"DAWN","reg=military,elite",{"0600, sunrise, watch change, report status","Morning, light's up, begin patrol","Dawn watch, nothing to report, over","Reveille, even if there's no bugle"}},
{"DAWN","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Dawn's the most dangerous hour, stay sharp"}},
{"DAWN","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"Another sunrise on a post I didn't want, sir"}},
{"DAWN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Morning light, hunting light, let's go"}},
{"DAWN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"Who the hell turned the sun on, I wasn't done sleeping"}},
{"DAWN","hour=4,6",{"Pre-dawn, it's cold, the quiet before the sun comes up"}},
{"DAWN","hour=6,8",{"Orange on the east, the whole sky's on fire, slowly"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=law",{"Somebody's moving out there. Keep watching","Got movement, far side of the field","Somebody out there, long way off","Someone out there, request ID","Movement at long range, unknown","Possible subjects, a quarter mile out, over","I see figures, a long way off, can't confirm","Far target, moving, keep watching"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=swat",{"Movement, far side","Somebody way out there","Distant movement - watch it","Someone out there, observing","Long range movement, marking","Possible hostiles, far side, holding","I see someone out there. Keep watching"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=military,elite",{"Movement, far side of the field","Think I see somebody, way out","Somebody out there. I don't know who"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Is somebody out there? Way down there?","I saw something move - way off","Somebody out there. Be careful"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Something moving way out there","Got somebody way off - keep an eye on him","Fresh one walking our way - slow"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Something's moving, way out there, I think","Someone's over there, I think, I don't know, could be nothing","Look, small shapes, far away, are they people?","I can see something, something far off, hold on","Way off in the distance, someone, or some thing","Shapes, shapes in the distance, I don't like it","Is that movement? Or am I just seeing things?","Huh, a long way off, there's something moving","I think I see somebody, far off, waving? Maybe not waving","Keep your voice down, there's something out there, far off"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Movement, long way out, nothing to worry about yet","Someone's out there, far off, watch them","Far shapes, can't tell yet, keep eyes on them","Distant movement, let's see which way it's heading","Something at the edge of sight, hold still","Long way off, not a threat, not yet","I've got somebody at a distance, not sure if friend or not","There, far side, see it? Don't point","Hold up, hold up, dot of movement, way over there"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"Something far out, we'll keep an eye on it","Way off yet, no rush","Movement way out, I'll watch it, you keep walking"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=military",{"Someone out there, sir, unidentified","Movement, long range, sir, two figures","Far target, sir, no hostile act","Possible enemy, sir, far side, holding fire"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","role=soldier_green",{"Sir, there's something out there, really far, what is it?","Sir, someone's out there, are they friendly?"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=elite",{"Someone out there, observing","Far movement, unidentified"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Someone's way out there, boss","Hey, look, tiny people, way off, think they're armed?","Way out there, way out there, who are they?","Hmm, somebody's out there, wait for 'em to come closer","Eyes on the distance, something's moving","Too far to shoot, too far to tell, just watch"}},
{"DISTANT_CONTACT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=fresh",{"There's someone, I think, I'm not sure, far off"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hello? Is anyone there? Please, we need help","Knock knock, anybody home? We mean no harm","Hello? Hello? We saw you were alive in there","Hi! Hi, sorry to bother you, can we talk?","Anybody? Please, anybody, we're lost"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"H-hello?? Please open up, please, we have nowhere to go","Please, please, we're cold and scared, please open"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=family|hour=16,22",{"Good evening, neighbor, may we trouble you a minute?"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=law,swat",{"Police, {sir}, anyone home?","Deputy, I need a word, folks"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=military,elite",{"Soldiers, open up, routine check","Patrol, residents, answer the door"}},
{"DOOR_KNOCK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Knock, knock, hey, in there, we've got a business offer","Come on, open up, I'm not gonna ask twice","Open the door, nice and easy, and nobody gets hurt"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"It's locked, of course it's locked","Locked, maybe there's a key somewhere","Locked... fucking figures","Damn it, it's locked, let me try the handle again","Locked, locked, who locks a door in the apocalypse? Oh wait, I would","Come ON, locked again!","Great, locked, I'm so tired of locked things"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=law",{"Locked, we'll have to go around"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=swat",{"Locked - breach?"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=military",{"Locked! Need another way in!"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=elite",{"Locked"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Locked, kick it in","Damn thing won't budge","Fuck, locked, kick it in","Locked, what a surprise, grab the crowbar","Aw, hell, locked, who's got a bobby pin?"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"It won't open, it won't open, what do we do?!","Locked!! Oh God, locked, we're stuck out here!"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=law,swat",{"Locked, find another way in","Door's locked, call it in"}},
{"DOOR_LOCKED","reg=military,elite",{"Entry locked, find an alternate","Locked, try the breach"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Slowly... slowly...","Opening it - stay behind me","Easy, easy, slow, slow, slow","Opening it- get behind me, go on","Here goes nothing, shh, shh","Easy... easy on the hinges, don't let it creak","Please be empty, please be empty, please be empty..."}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=law",{"Opening the door - hold"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=swat",{"Door"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=military",{"Opening - ready"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=elite",{"Door open"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Here goes","Alright, boys, quiet, quiet, here we go","Open it, open it, what's the worst that could happen?"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh God... okay, just open it, just OPEN the damn thing","I can't look, you look, you open it!"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=law,swat",{"Opening, hold your position","Door open, cover me"}},
{"DOOR_OPENING","reg=military,elite",{"Breaching, three, two, one","Door, door, ready"}},
{"DRESS_WARM","",{"Found a sweater in the pack - why didn't I think of that?","Putting on another layer","Cold's winning, time for the heavy coat","These gloves were in the bottom of the bag the whole time","Another pair of socks, dry ones, thank God","Hat on - scarf on, not stylish, but who's looking","Layers - always layers","I should have done this an hour ago"}},
