{"FLANK_START","reg=law",{"I'm going around the side - keep him busy","Flanking left - cover my move","Moving to flank, I need cover","Swinging left, left, stay on them","I'll take the east side, you hold the center","Deputy, take the right, I'll get behind them","Flanking, stay on their front","Coming around, hold your fire on the left"}},
