{"FLANK_START","reg=military",{"Flanking left! Cover fire!","Going around! Keep his head down!","Moving to flank, sir","Taking the left flank, hold the front","Flanking maneuver, cover me","On the move, left flank, keep their heads down","Squad two, flank right, go go go","Circling round, hold fire on my side"}},
{"FLANK_START","reg=elite",{"Flanking - right side","Flanking","Moving left, cover","Going round, stay on them","Wide left, wait for my signal"}},
{"FLANK_START","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"I'll go around the back - keep him busy","Boys, go around and get him from behind","I'll go around, y'all keep 'em busy","Hey, you, go left, I'll go right, we surround 'em","Circle round, circle round, don't let 'em see you","Boss, I'm going to flank 'em, give me a minute","Get behind the bastards, go, go","Keep shooting at their front, I'm sneaking round the back","Let's get 'em from the side, they won't see it coming"}},
{"FLANK_START","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'll- I'll go around, okay? Around the side? Is that okay?","Somebody has to go left, I guess it's me, God help me","Wait, let me try the side, I think I can get behind it","I'm going wide- that's ME out here, don't shoot me!","Don't look at me, I'm going around, I'm going around...","Cover me from here, I'm sneaking to the left","I'll try to come at it from behind, just keep it busy"}},
{"FLANK_START","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Going left, keep their eyes on you","I'll swing round the back, you hold the front","On my way around, give me thirty seconds","Taking the left, you take the right, meet in the middle","I'll circle wide, keep them looking at you","Going around, keep it noisy up front","Pulling around the side, don't shoot at movement on your left","Out wide, quiet, don't let them see me","Quick, circle the far side, I'll keep them busy"}},
{"FLANK_START","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"I'll come at them from the side","Moving round, you hold here"}},
{"FLANK_START","role=worker",{"Okay, I'll go round the back, don't let 'em chew on you while I'm gone","Keep 'em busy, I'm taking the long way"}},
