{"FOOD_MEMORY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I'd give my left boot for a Spiffo's burger right now","Sweet tea with real ice","I'd give a finger for my aunt's banana pudding","A greasy cheeseburger, a basket of fries, a cold Coke","Mom's meatloaf, the one with the ketchup glaze, oh God","I'd trade my left hand for one of my mom's biscuits","Meatloaf, Thursday night meatloaf, gravy and all, God","Pizza, a big greasy pizza with extra cheese, I'd cry","A cold Coke in a glass bottle, the one that fizzes up your nose","Hot dogs on the grill, in the backyard, Fourth of July, with the whole family","Fried chicken from the Colonel's, the original recipe, that's all I think about"}},
